\" title=\"Dune Whetstone - in 5% of 20 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/856bbd4f9ab72fa1ff47.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Whetstone</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">5% · 1/20</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"werewolfpelt-head\" title=\"Werewolfpelt Head - in 5% of 20 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/69bc975155db9bef5f6d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolfpelt Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">5% · 1/20</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Shoddy: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-head\" title=\"Titanium Head - in 5% of 20 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b0a1dcb7a8a29c4f1ffd.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">5% · 1/20</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"shagbark-bow\" title=\"Shagbark Bow - in 5% of 20 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6ad40ed0b4459385c272.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Shagbark Bow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">5% · 1/20</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Sunscald Hold</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 59</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-231\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where